#Codeberg #Opensource</div>
      
        <div class="tg-websummary-layout"><div class="tg-websummary-layout"><div class="tg-websummary-layout">
          <a target="_blank" href="https://codeberg.org/Codeberg/org/src/branch/main/TermsOfUse.md">Codeberg.org</a>
          <h6>org/TermsOfUse.md at main</h6>
          <p>org - Official Codeberg Documents and their unofficial translations.</p>
            <img loading="lazy" class="tg-img tg-photo" src="https://tien-kou-kari.github.io/misc/tg/media/m-5867360703332071170.png" title="Telegram wepbage media id 5867360703332071170" alt="A picture related to current telegram webpage message. No more alt detail for now." />
